OL,3,AHundreds of thousands of students set
OL,4,Ato receive GCSE and BTec results
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn England, GCSEs are graded using a
OL,7,Fnumerical system from 9-1, while in
OL,8,FWales and Northern Ireland they are
OL,9,Fstill graded using letters from A* to U
OL,11,FStudents in Scotland have already
OL,12,Freceived their results, with the pass
OL,13,Frate up slightly on last year
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
